  "description": "Writes a Scrubkit FileRecord table to Apache Parquet (columnar) for data-lake and analytics ingestion, using Parquet.Net. References only Scrubkit.Abstractions; the zero-dependency CSV/JSON writers live in the core Scrubkit package.",
